Severity: INFO
Category: logging
Check: check_remotelog
References: rsyslog.conf(5); syslog-ng.conf(5)

Logs are forwarded off this host, to the destinations named. That is
the arrangement to have: an intruder who fills or wipes the local logs
cannot touch the copies elsewhere. The finding exists so the JSON says
where the copies go.
